<p style="font-size:.86em;margin:.7rem 0 0;color:var(--ink-faint);">This is why the proof assistants below are built on intuitionistic type theory — and why <em>logic and computation</em>, one of our five threads, are not neighbors but the same country seen from two sides. (Picked up on <strong>Days 27–29</strong>.)</p>
